# This file is IDENTICAL to v5.1.1 EXCEPT for the
# sections shown below. Copy v5.1.1 fully, then
# REPLACE these specific resources.
# ============================================================

# Change Description in header:

Description: >
  Fixyachips Global v5.2 LAUNCH EDITION
  Scaled for 5000 RPS sustained, 10000 burst.
  REQUIRES SES production access + Lambda quota review.


