📋 Quick Reference: How to Use These Files
To deploy v5.1.1 (NOW)

aws cloudformation deploy \
  --template-file fixyachips-v5.1.1.yaml \
  --stack-name fixyachips-prod \
  --capabilities CAPABILITY_IAM CAPABILITY_NAMED_IAM \
  --region us-east-1

To upgrade to v5.2 LATER

    Build a complete fixyachips-v5.2.yaml by starting from v5.1.1 and applying all 8 DELTAs.
    Make sure pre-deployment requirements are done.
    Run the same deploy command pointed at v5.2. CloudFormation will do an in-place update.
    After your launch event, you can re-deploy v5.1.1 to scale back down and save money.

